ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/91b7761b578d1962be669ecc44e076b9.avif?t=1749095390\" data-has-big /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.poster.avif?t=1749095390\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.webm?t=1749095390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2370000/extras/5bd1b1bf7f027fc38da6e03b947f714e.mp4?t=1749095390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let the electrifying soundtrack by Hydelic, acclaimed composer of Tetris Effect: Connected and Rez Infinite\u2019s Area X, take you to new depths of immersion. You\u2019ll want to throw on a pair of your favorite headphones for maximum effectiveness. Use the Playlist feature to create a mix of stages with your favorite tracks or to set a specific mood.\u00a0</p>",
